<title>USA: WesBanco Inc Q4 shr increases.</title>
<headline>WesBanco Inc Q4 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>WHEELING, W.Va. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.50		    $0.47</p>
<p> Net			  5,088		    4,842</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,224		   10,141</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.08		    $1.98</p>
<p> Net			 21,161		   20,304</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,169		   10.160</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 provision for loan losses was $1.49 million versus $1.10 million in Q4 1995.</p>
<p>Total assets at December 31, 1996, were $1.68 billion versus $1.55 billion at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
